The Zerg language specification — Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International.

This directory, together with the GRAMMAR file at the repository root, is the
definition of the language. It is licensed CC-BY-SA-4.0; the full text is in
LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt.

Quote it, translate it, teach from it, and implement against it — with
attribution, and with derivative documents under the same license. See LICENSE at
the root for the one thing this does not grant: the name.

